# The follow button is a third zoom button: same size, corner radius, plate and column as the engine's + and -, the same
# gap below - (tests/tools/check_follow_shots.py measures the shots). Display scale 1x; off by default, on with G.
title GPS: follow button beside the zoom buttons, scale 1x
sizes 640x480 480x320 320x480
env DECKATLAS_DEMO 1
env DECKATLAS_GPS auto
env DECKATLAS_GPS_FEED fix3d
env DECKATLAS_SCALE 1
env DECKATLAS_VIEW 48.889643,2.269995,16

wait 1500
shot follow-off
expect text "Map"
key g
wait 400
shot follow-on
